          "summary",
          "A month of paying per write, from someone who runs nothing"
        ],
        [
          "r",
          "https://example.com/otter/floating"
        ]
      ],
      "content": "I have never run a relay. I float on other people's, and I pay them a little each time I write. This is a note on what that is like after a month.\n\nThe first thing you notice is that nobody asks who you are. The second is that the bill is tiny and it is always there. You stop writing things that are not worth one unit.\n\nThe relays I stay on are the ones that say what they charge before I ask."
    },
